        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Accordingly, we invest in our employees by prioritizing their safety, offering numerous training and development opportunities, valuing employee feedback, providing competitive compensation that shares in the success of our business, delivering comprehensive health and wellness benefits, and fostering an inclusive and respectful workplace.",
        "start_character": 53498,
        "end_character": 53839
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001622536-26-000017",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001622536-26-000017-fc8d603cb14280f7",
        "accession_number": "0001622536-26-000017",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to optimizing core operations, we believe we can unlock further value from our existing assets by driving the highest value per megawatt produced—supported by long-term power sales to computing, industrial, and other end users across our reliable portfolio that provides both baseload and dispatchable generation.",
        "start_character": 23661,
        "end_character": 23986
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001622536-26-000017",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001622536-26-000017-fc8d603cb14280f7",
        "accession_number": "0001622536-26-000017",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our business also provides significant support to the communities in which we operate in the form of critical services, high-quality jobs, economic development, and tax dollars.",
        "start_character": 51547,
        "end_character": 51724
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001622536-26-000017",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001622536-26-000017-fc8d603cb14280f7",
        "accession_number": "0001622536-26-000017",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "These drivers of demand have had, and could continue to have, direct impacts on the overall supply/demand balance and resulting energy and capacity prices in the markets in which we operate, the profitability, value, and growth prospects of our business, and the regulatory framework under which we operate.",
        "start_character": 12965,
        "end_character": 13272
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001622536-26-000017",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001622536-26-000017-fc8d603cb14280f7",
        "accession_number": "0001622536-26-000017",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "This cycle—contract assets, add assets, contract again—which we call the “Talen flywheel,” is designed to increase the number of high-quality, contractable opportunities across the portfolio, enabling us to pair reliable assets with long-term, creditworthy demand in a way that enhances stability while preserving flexibility.",
        "start_character": 30347,
        "end_character": 30673
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001622536-26-000017",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001622536-26-000017-fc8d603cb14280f7",
        "accession_number": "0001622536-26-000017",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We produce and sell electricity, capacity, and ancillary services into wholesale U.S.",
        "start_character": 297,
        "end_character": 382
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001622536-26-000017",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001622536-26-000017-fc8d603cb14280f7",
        "accession_number": "0001622536-26-000017",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We sell energy/ancillary services into these markets.",
        "start_character": 9371,
        "end_character": 9424
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001622536-26-000017",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001622536-26-000017-fc8d603cb14280f7",
        "accession_number": "0001622536-26-000017",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As further discussed below, we sell capacity and energy through a combination of forward auctions, future contracts, and spot market sales (as applicable).",
        "start_character": 6105,
        "end_character": 6260
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001622536-26-000017",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001622536-26-000017-fc8d603cb14280f7",
        "accession_number": "0001622536-26-000017",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Importantly, these arrangements will also enable more efficient planning and resource deployment across the Company and the markets in which we operate.",
        "start_character": 24886,
        "end_character": 25038
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001622536-26-000017",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001622536-26-000017-fc8d603cb14280f7",
        "accession_number": "0001622536-26-000017",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Prior to its sale to AWS, we initially developed the data center campus adjacent to our Susquehanna facility, the world’s first 24x7 carbon-free, direct-connect data center campus, to provide digital infrastructure powered by generation from Susquehanna.",
        "start_character": 49853,
        "end_character": 50107
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001622536-26-000017",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001622536-26-000017-fc8d603cb14280f7",
        "accession_number": "0001622536-26-000017",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Risk Factors—Regulatory, Environmental, and Legal Risks—We could be impacted by changes in, or state interference with, the structure or operation of the markets in which we operate, including ongoing market restructuring in PJM.”",
        "start_character": 19507,
        "end_character": 19737
      },
      {
